A man wearing a wingsuit glides through the air with a constant velocity of $47\text{ m s}^{-1}$ at an angle of $24^{\circ}$ to the horizontal. The path of the man is shown in Fig. 2.1.
{{figure:figure_2_1.png}}
The total mass of the man and the wingsuit is $85\text{ kg}$. The man takes a time of $2.8$ minutes to glide from point $A$ to point $B$.
